<title>USA: TABLE-Northern Technologies Int'l Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Northern Technologies Int'l Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>LINO LAKES, Minn. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter Ended May 31		   1997	    1996</p>
<p> Sales					 $2,518,582    $1,751,478</p>
<p> Net Income				     733,260	 507,039</p>
<p> Earnings per common share			.17	     .12</p>
<p> Nine Months Ended May 31		     1997	    1996</p>
<p> Sales					  6,532,957     4,977,396</p>
<p> Net Income				   1,796,371     1,384,098</p>
<p> Earnings per common share			.42	     .32</p>
<p>NOTE: Higher net income for the third quarter of 1997 and the nine-month period reflects increased sales, rising technical assistance fees and equity in earnings of corporate joint ventures.</p>
<p>Northern Technologies International Corp is full company name.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
